    "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at 1.10.1 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### New features \ud83c\udf89\n* feat: add close_link method to TransportUnicast API by @gabrik in https://github.com/eclipse-zenoh/zenoh/pull/2745\n### Bug fixes \ud83d\udc1e\n* Fix gossip scouting for loopback locators by @fuzzypixelz in https://github.com/eclipse-zenoh/zenoh/pull/2755\n* Fix content-type HTTP header extraction from encoding in REST plugin by @JEnoch in https://github.com/eclipse-zenoh/zenoh/pull/2758\n* fix: clear pending connection for empty scout locators by @stan603-source in https://github.com/eclipse-zenoh/zenoh/pull/2759\n\n## New Contributors\n* @stan603-source made their first contribution in https://github.com/eclipse-zenoh/zenoh/pull/2759\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/eclipse-zenoh/zenoh/compare/1.10.0...1.10.1",
